OL,3,AUS and China must act as responsible
OL,4,Aglobal powers together, Xi says at
OL,5,AWhite House dinner
OL,6,
OL,7,FDonald Trump and First Lady Melania
OL,8,Fwelcomed Xi Jinping and his wife Peng
OL,9,FLiyuan to the White House for a state
OL,10,Fdinner
OL,12,FIn his remarks at the dinner, Xi urged
OL,13,Ffor a "new approach" for China and the
OL,14,FUS to act as responsible global powers
OL,15,Fin a changing world
OL,17,FIn his remarks, Trump gifted Xi a
OL,18,Fstatue of a bald eagle and said they
OL,19,Fhave "never gotten along better"
