OL,3,AUS and China must act as responsible
OL,4,Aglobal powers together, Xi says at
OL,5,AWhite House dinner
OL,6,
OL,7,FWho is on the invite list? Big tech
OL,8,Fbosses including Tesla's Elon Musk,
OL,9,FApple's Tim Cook, OpenAI's Sam Altman
OL,10,Fand Nvidia's Jensen Huang attended
OL,12,FEarlier, Trump said he and Xi had made
OL,13,F"tremendous strides on the issues
OL,14,Ffacing our two countries"; Xi,
OL,15,Fmeanwhile, said he hoped "Chinese
OL,16,Fcompanies are treated fairly here"
